            <div xml:id="d188">

                <pb facs="0715" n="703" sameAs="frus:frus1946v04/pg703"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">C.P.(Gen)Doc.1.J.1.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article 65, § 9</hi></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-outside-research" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1946-10-15T23:59:59+01:00" notBefore="1946-07-29T00:00:00+01:00"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>At the end of Article 65 add a new paragraph 9, worded as follows: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“<hi rendition="#italic">Any instrument drawn up or contract concluded
                                during the war on occupied territory between Greek and Italian
                                nationals, purporting to transfer Greek property, subsequently
                                removed to Italy, shall be null and void</hi>.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
            </div>
        </body>
